<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<dmn:definitions xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20180521/DC/" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20180521/DI/" xmlns:dmn="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20240513/MODEL/" xmlns:dmndi="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20230324/DMNDI/" xmlns:kie="https://kie.org/dmn/extensions/1.0" id="_BB50D996-0752-4907-835E-1E51C119FE91" name="HouseholdHasLiheapCitizenshipStatus" typeLanguage="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20240513/FEEL/" namespace="https://kie.apache.org/dmn/_61FA29B0-01EE-4DD9-A511-0E7950519CB3" xmlns="https://kie.apache.org/dmn/_61FA29B0-01EE-4DD9-A511-0E7950519CB3" xmlns:feel="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20240513/FEEL/" xmlns:included1="https://kie.apache.org/dmn/_1B91A885-130A-4E0B-A762-E12AA6DD5C79" xmlns:included2="https://kie.apache.org/dmn/_1E67E3B3-A210-42FE-9B47-EE79BC1A653D">
  <dmn:description>Screen whether any household member not excluded under §601.41(1) has U.S. citizenship or a listed LIHEAP noncitizen status; not complete member eligibility.</dmn:description>
  <dmn:extensionElements>
    <kie:attachment name="FY2027 LIHEAP final state plan — Appendix B, §§601.31(4), 601.41, 601.81" url="https://www.pa.gov/content/dam/copapwp-pagov/en/dhs/documents/services/assistance/documents/heating-assistance_liheap/2027-liheap-state-plan.pdf" />
  </dmn:extensionElements>
  <dmn:import id="_72078FCA-D7A0-4208-A4F1-B7D2E7758771" name="BDT" namespace="https://kie.apache.org/dmn/_1B91A885-130A-4E0B-A762-E12AA6DD5C79" locationURI="../../BDT.dmn" importType="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20240513/MODEL/" />
  <dmn:import id="_20B3F335-D7D4-488F-BEB6-346D2642BB84" name="Citizenship" namespace="https://kie.apache.org/dmn/_1E67E3B3-A210-42FE-9B47-EE79BC1A653D" locationURI="Citizenship.dmn" importType="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20240513/MODEL/" />
  <dmn:itemDefinition id="_155375AB-D911-4109-9231-47029D785171" name="tSituation" isCollection="false">
    <dmn:description>Minimal local projection for HouseholdHasLiheapCitizenshipStatus. Reuse the canonical field meanings in BDT.dmn or Enrollment.dmn; only fields consumed by this model are included.</dmn:description>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_E22CB4D6-6C30-48C6-8C37-3C8B9A0C7E34" name="people" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:typeRef>tPersonList</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
  </dmn:itemDefinition>
  <dmn:itemDefinition id="_19BDD90A-64D9-4C6E-AC63-1E15CD3DBB4D" name="tPerson" isCollection="false">
    <dmn:description>Minimal local projection for HouseholdHasLiheapCitizenshipStatus. Reuse the canonical field meanings in BDT.dmn or Enrollment.dmn; only fields consumed by this model are included.</dmn:description>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_425D5D41-3BEF-4F4A-B167-B27AF050B37C" name="citizenshipStatus" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:description>What is this person's U.S. citizenship or immigration status? Ask about every household member, including children. Values and their meanings are defined on BDT tCitizenshipStatus. Missing is unknown. No names, documents or dates of entry are needed for this screen.</dmn:description>
      <dmn:typeRef>BDT.tCitizenshipStatus</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
    <dmn:itemComponent id="_6BB7D810-CE80-49D9-821F-C3F89B31DADE" name="excludedFromLiheapHousehold" isCollection="false">
      <dmn:description>Is this person left out of the LIHEAP household under Appendix B §601.41(1)? True if the person is only staying temporarily for a reason such as a visit, vacation or education; lives in an institution, dormitory, fraternity or sorority house or boarding home; is incarcerated, or is a convicted felon fleeing to avoid prosecution, custody or confinement; or already received a LIHEAP Cash benefit this program year as a member of another household. False if none applies. Missing is unknown. Citizenship and immigration status are recorded separately in citizenshipStatus.</dmn:description>
      <dmn:typeRef>boolean</dmn:typeRef>
    </dmn:itemComponent>
  </dmn:itemDefinition>
  <dmn:itemDefinition id="_804ED74F-2442-4C63-A224-797BBE16CA17" name="tPersonList" isCollection="true">
    <dmn:description>Minimal local projection for HouseholdHasLiheapCitizenshipStatus. Reuse the canonical field meanings in BDT.dmn or Enrollment.dmn; only fields consumed by this model are included.</dmn:description>
    <dmn:typeRef>tPerson</dmn:typeRef>
  </dmn:itemDefinition>
  <dmn:decisionService id="_5E761202-0066-4FFE-833C-0C8AB291742B" name="HouseholdHasLiheapCitizenshipStatusService">
    <dmn:extensionElements />
    <dmn:variable id="_B8CC53F6-727B-45B6-BACF-8AA042E35895" name="HouseholdHasLiheapCitizenshipStatusService" typeRef="BDT.tCheckResponse" />
    <dmn:outputDecision href="#_5AE36CFD-D101-4993-BE69-AD149AAF235E" />
    <dmn:inputData href="#_2D252769-1A4E-4FE4-9DB8-C019C637CF81" />
  </dmn:decisionService>
  <dmn:decision id="_5AE36CFD-D101-4993-BE69-AD149AAF235E" name="checkResult">
    <dmn:description>Screen FY2027 Appendix B §601.31(4) citizenship/noncitizen status across the recorded household people, counting only people not excluded from the household under §601.41(1)(i)–(iii) and (v). Any counted person who is a U.S. citizen, has a listed noncitizen status or is a trafficking victim passes this requirement, even when another person's status is unknown. §601.31(4) does not list trafficking victims, but it applies federal law, and 22 U.S.C. 7105(b)(1) makes them eligible for federally funded benefits to the same extent as refugees. An excluded person never counts, so a household whose only qualifying person is excluded fails. Fails only when every recorded person is excluded or none-of-these. Missing or empty people, null people, missing status or exclusion, other-or-unsure and unrecognized values remain unknown unless another person passes. Record every household member, including children; do not require every member or the person completing the screener to qualify. Do not impose a five-year wait or infer a listed status from nationality or an application alone. This self-reported screen defers documentation to application; it does not establish complete member eligibility. Income and household-size preparation remain separate under §§601.41 and 601.81, including required income from ineligible members. Policy reviewed 2026-10-22; replaces the broad determination reviewed 2026-10-15.</dmn:description>
    <dmn:extensionElements>
      <kie:attachment name="FY2027 LIHEAP final state plan — Appendix B, §§601.31(4), 601.41, 601.81" url="https://www.pa.gov/content/dam/copapwp-pagov/en/dhs/documents/services/assistance/documents/heating-assistance_liheap/2027-liheap-state-plan.pdf" />
      <kie:attachment name="22 U.S.C. 7105(b)(1) — benefits for trafficking victims to the same extent as refugees" url="https://uscode.house.gov/view.xhtml?req=granuleid:USC-prelim-title22-section7105&amp;num=0&amp;edition=prelim" />
    </dmn:extensionElements>
    <dmn:variable id="_ECD376E7-386A-4FF9-888C-BEFB823932CD" name="checkResult" typeRef="boolean" />
    <dmn:informationRequirement id="_66714105-CADF-4E3C-B03D-B849B7A2F80D">
      <dmn:requiredInput href="#_2D252769-1A4E-4FE4-9DB8-C019C637CF81" />
    </dmn:informationRequirement>
    <dmn:literalExpression id="_E2AD24B7-A665-4E4D-A8B2-7D8F96523293">
      <dmn:text>if situation.people = null or count(situation.people) = 0 then null
else any(for person in situation.people return
  if person = null then null
  else not(person.excludedFromLiheapHousehold) and (
    if person.citizenshipStatus = null then null
    else if list contains(["us-citizen", "permanent-resident", "asylee", "refugee", "paroled-at-least-one-year", "withholding-of-deportation-or-removal", "conditional-entrant", "cuban-haitian-entrant", "qualified-battered-noncitizen", "iraqi-afghan-special-immigrant", "cofa-migrant", "trafficking-victim"], person.citizenshipStatus) then true
    else if person.citizenshipStatus = "none-of-these" then false
    else null))</dmn:text>
    </dmn:literalExpression>
  </dmn:decision>
  <dmn:inputData id="_2D252769-1A4E-4FE4-9DB8-C019C637CF81" name="situation">
    <dmn:description>Recorded facts projected from the canonical BDT situation. Supply the fields used by this model; see the check decision for missing/invalid-input behavior.</dmn:description>
    <dmn:extensionElements />
    <dmn:variable id="_86D21EDC-CCD9-4706-BDE1-19D4CD9AE2B6" name="situation" typeRef="tSituation" />
  </dmn:inputData>
